  "result": "Excellent! All 47 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**New error codes** in src/errors.js:\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: when trying to remove a line that doesn't exist\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: when trying to modify a non-draft invoice\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 Adds or updates a line:\n- Adds a new line at the end if the SKU isn't already on the invoice\n- Increases qty if the SKU already exists\n- Validates qty (must be a positive integer) and SKU (must exist in catalogue)\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` error if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` or `fail(code)`\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 Removes a line:\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if removing it would leave the invoice empty\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` or `fail(code)`\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n**12 new tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and updating existing ones\n- Quantity validation for addLine\n- SKU validation for addLine\n- Draft status requirement for both functions\n- Immutability for both functions\n- Proper error handling (LINE_NOT_FOUND, NO_LINES, NOT_DRAFT)\n- Chaining addLine and removeLine operations",
